  {
   "channel_id": "C8STOCK",
   "reactions": [],
   "reply_count": 0,
   "text": "Register's keyed from the journal pages. I went down them in print order, should be fine.",
   "thread_ts": null,
   "ts": "1812000000.000000",
   "user_id": "U8OWAIN"
  },
  {
   "channel_id": "C8STOCK",
   "reactions": [],
   "reply_count": 0,
   "text": "Ruling from me: just use average cost for the spring close, the auditors never look at lots. Post the stock number here when you have it.",
   "thread_ts": null,
   "ts": "1812000900.000000",
   "user_id": "U8MD"
  },
  {
   "channel_id": "C8STOCK",
   "reactions": [],
   "reply_count": 0,
   "text": "Frost always comes off the oldest stock, that's how we've always done it.",
   "thread_ts": null,
   "ts": "1812001800.000000",
   "user_id": "U8TOM"
  },
  {
   "channel_id": "C8STOCK",
   "reactions": [],
   "reply_count": 0,
   "text": "Declan signed the Harrow Herbs credit, so take the lavender at 1.95.",
   "thread_ts": null,
   "ts": "1812002700.000000",
   "user_id": "U8BEA"
  },
  {
   "channel_id": "C8STOCK",
   "reactions": [],
   "reply_count": 0,
   "text": "Returned plants just go back into the lot they came out of.",
   "thread_ts": null,
   "ts": "1812003600.000000",
   "user_id": "U8OWAIN"
  },
  {
   "channel_id": "C8STOCK",
   "reactions": [],
   "reply_count": 0,
   "text": "The handling charge went up to 0.55, use that for the whole spring.",
   "thread_ts": null,
   "ts": "1812004500.000000",
   "user_id": "U8TOM"
  },
  {
   "channel_id": "C8STOCK",
   "reactions": [],
   "reply_count": 0,
   "text": "Box comes in trays of 15, I think.",
   "thread_ts": null,
   "ts": "1812005400.000000",
   "user_id": "U8BEA"
  },
  {
   "channel_id": "C8STOCK",
   "reactions": [],
   "reply_count": 0,
   "text": "Ashby Grange's stock sheet is in the journal folder, it's the same group so count their lots too.",
   "thread_ts": null,
   "ts": "1812006300.000000",
   "user_id": "U8TOM"
  },
  {
   "channel_id": "C8STOCK",
   "reactions": [],
   "reply_count": 0,
   "text": "Van 2 is booked for the Kingsmead delivery on Thursday.",
   "thread_ts": null,
   "ts": "1812007200.000000",
   "user_id": "U8BEA"
  },
  {
   "channel_id": "C8STOCK",
   "reactions": [],
   "reply_count": 0,
   "text": "Pretty sure B9 was only 8 bamboo dead, not 12. FR-07 has it wrong, I'd go with 8.",
   "thread_ts": null,
   "ts": "1812008100.000000",
   "user_id": "U8OWAIN"
  },
  {
   "channel_id": "C8STOCK",
   "reactions": [],
   "reply_count": 0,
   "text": "Potting shed rota for June is on the board.",
   "thread_ts": null,
   "ts": "1812009000.000000",
   "user_id": "U8TOM"
  },
  {
   "channel_id": "C8STOCK",
   "reactions": [],
   "reply_count": 0,
   "text": "FR-07 correction from me, as the one who signed it: once the fleece came off, 8 of the lavender on bench B8 recovered and went back on sale. Bench B8 is 22 plants killed, not 30. B7 and B9 stand as reported.",
   "thread_ts": null,
   "ts": "1812009900.000000",
   "user_id": "U8TOM"
  },
  {
   "channel_id": "C8STOCK",
   "reactions": [],
   "reply_count": 0,
   "text": "Trade counter closes early on Friday for the stock count.",
   "thread_ts": null,
   "ts": "1812010800.000000",
   "user_id": "U8BEA"
  },
  {
   "channel_id": "C8STOCK",
   "reactions": [],
   "reply_count": 0,
   "text": "Bank wants the stock number by Wednesday.",
   "thread_ts": null,
   "ts": "1812011700.000000",
   "user_id": "U8MD"
  },
  {
   "channel_id": "C8STOCK",
   "reactions": [],
   "reply_count": 0,
   "text": "Please don't reply in here about the close, I'll pick it up.",
   "thread_ts": null,
   "ts": "1812012600.000000",
   "user_id": "U8RUTH"
  },
  {
   "channel_id": "C8STOCK",
   "reactions": [],
   "reply_count": 0,
